      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "68b641a359803a5f",
      "translationZh": "查看由 Jayanta Sadhu 和另外 2 位作者撰写的论文《DERELAB：利用生成式基准探测 LLMs 的可撤销推理与确认偏误》的 PDF",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "215d3f17e4b9e713",
